--------------

Glyphs of the faces above are compiled into the firmware as LVGL font
sources (components/ui/fonts/, components/ui/fonts_p4/,
components/ui/fonts_knob/) and shipped in every binary built from this
repository. The SIL OFL 1.1 and CC BY 4.0 attributions above apply to
those built binaries as well: Montserrat (c) JulietaUla, OFL; Font
Awesome Free (c) Fonticons Inc., glyphs CC BY 4.0, font OFL.

NASA imagery and the product photos
-----------------------------------

* The lunar albedo (LROC WAC, 4096x2048) and relief (LOLA, 16 px/deg) used
  to bake the per-board textures come from the NASA SVS CGI Moon Kit
  (https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/4720/) and the Moon Phases 2025 frames from
  NASA SVS 5415 (https://svs.gsfc.nasa.gov/5415/); the 8760-hour ephemeris
  records come from the NASA dialamoon API. These are works of the U.S.
  government and are not subject to U.S. copyright (17 U.S.C. 105) —
  NASA's media-usage guidelines state that the materials may be used
  without permission and request a credit, which the source URLs above
  give. No binaries from these sources are committed; they are re-fetched
  (sha256-pinned) by assets/images/moon/get_assets.py.

* The product photos used in the documentation (docs/tools/waveshare-*.webp,
  and as the backdrop of the committed docs/_static/photos/sim_home.webp
  hero) are Waveshare product images, credited here: Waveshare —
  ESP32-S3-Touch-AMOLED-1.75 and ESP32-P4-WIFI6-Touch-LCD-XC product
  photography (https://www.waveshare.com/).

Build-time dependencies
-----------------------

LVGL and the other Espressif/Waveshare components (see idf_component.yml
and dependencies.lock) are fetched from the ESP-IDF component registry at
build time into the gitignored managed_components/ directory; each ships
with its own license file in the registry (LVGL 9.6: MIT, Copyright
(c) 2025 LVGL Kft; esp32_p4_wifi6_touch_lcd_xc: Apache-2.0;
pcf85063a: Apache-2.0). They are not part of this source tree.
